<meta property="og:title" content="Technical Program Schedule | IEEE ASRU 2025 | Honolulu, Hawaii, USA">
<meta name="description" content="2025 IEEE Automatic Speech Recognition and Understanding Workshop is mainly focused on bringing together academia and industry in an intimate environment to discuss new developments on the field of Automatic Speech Recognition and Understanding. This includes but is not limited to speech recognition systems, spoken dialog systems, speech analysis, paralinguistics phenomena that appear in speech, applications of automatic speech recognition and speech analysis, large language models for speech, and speech foundation models.">
